{"schema_version":"nox-r2-complete-raw-registry-v1","record_id":"iirepresent-0359","origin":{"collection":"iirepresent","original_row_number":359,"raw_json_pointer":"/358"},"raw":{"description":"Как создавать вирусные видео в sora2Придумываем сценарий для истории, я использовал ChatGPT, сейчас хорошо набирает тематика истории и интересных открытийSora 2 — Переходим в этого бота, и генерируем фоновые видео под каждое предложение достаточно 5-10 роликовПромпты делал в ChatGPT, один из них:Animated, hand-drawn colored illustration style inspired by traditional Japanese ink paintings and modern cinematic anime.Ancient Japan at dusk. A lone samurai stands in falling snow, holding a katana pointed downward. His armor is worn, his face calm and resolute. Soft wind moves his cloak and cherry blossom petals through the air.Slow cinematic camera push-in. Warm and cold colors contrast — deep reds, muted blues, parchment textures.The atmosphere is solemn and fatalistic, symbolizing revenge and honor. The samurai knows he will die, yet does not hesitate.Painterly lighting, visible brush strokes, dramatic shadows, no realism, no modern elements.Vertical 9:16, 4–5 seconds, cinematic, emotional, quiet.elevenlabs — тут делаем озвучку на любом языке, с любой интонацией и темпом, лучше сейчас не найти. Ноооо можно найти дешевле, если полистать канал..@iirepresent","link":"https://elevenlabs.io/"},"raw_record_json":"{\"description\":\"Как создавать вирусные видео в sora2Придумываем сценарий для истории, я использовал ChatGPT, сейчас хорошо набирает тематика истории и интересных открытийSora 2 — Переходим в этого бота, и генерируем фоновые видео под каждое предложение достаточно 5-10 роликовПромпты делал в ChatGPT, один из них:Animated, hand-drawn colored illustration style inspired by traditional Japanese ink paintings and modern cinematic anime.Ancient Japan at dusk. A lone samurai stands in falling snow, holding a katana pointed downward. His armor is worn, his face calm and resolute. Soft wind moves his cloak and cherry blossom petals through the air.Slow cinematic camera push-in. Warm and cold colors contrast — deep reds, muted blues, parchment textures.The atmosphere is solemn and fatalistic, symbolizing revenge and honor. The samurai knows he will die, yet does not hesitate.Painterly lighting, visible brush strokes, dramatic shadows, no realism, no modern elements.Vertical 9:16, 4–5 seconds, cinematic, emotional, quiet.elevenlabs — тут делаем озвучку на любом языке, с любой интонацией и темпом, лучше сейчас не найти. Ноооо можно найти дешевле, если полистать канал..@iirepresent\",\"link\":\"https://elevenlabs.io/\"}","identity":{"raw_url":"https://elevenlabs.io/","normalized_exact_url":"https://elevenlabs.io/","normalized_address_key":"elevenlabs.io/","url_host":"elevenlabs.io","owner_repo":"UNKNOWN"},"classification":{"semantic_class":"service","method":"DETERMINISTIC_HEURISTIC_NOT_UPSTREAM_VERIFIED","operation_purposes":["observability_economics"],"contours":["B_KNOWLEDGE_COMPETENCE"],"confidence":"LOW","heuristic_not_ground_truth":true},"historical":{"historical_category":"Медиа - Аудио и речь","historical_confidence":"high","historical_resource_type":"website_or_service","historical_flags":"description_mentions_multiple_services"},"crosswalk":{"card_path":"20 - Записи/Медиа---Аудио-и-речь/iirepresent-0359.md","card_sha256":"eb5e2cd2128d839983fd604e2c200c1ada5277aeff6e8c95a2bce4e0ddf108c7","exact_candidate_group_id":"DUP_fcb4f9235745f167","exact_candidate_members":["iirepresent-0359"],"address_candidate_group_id":"DUP_c228f9559e05940c","address_candidate_members":["iirepresent-0359"]},"status":{"maturity_stage":"RAW_CANDIDATE","readiness":"UNVETTED","verdict":"H","research_status":"DOCUMENTED_L1_CROSSWALKED","current_health":"UNKNOWN","installed_version":"UNKNOWN","authorized":"UNKNOWN","actually_called":"UNKNOWN","result_qa":"UNKNOWN","currently_released":"UNKNOWN","license_status":"UNKNOWN","upstream_version_release_commit":"UNKNOWN","